{"title":"Q","artist":"가우르 구라, 모리 칼리오페","sourceId":"reference:KnBuaW8Vn2NFnYnAU0n2","sourceHash":"3774f2a4a3dabba07cd20d71e9da81e7b6425fba9bec5900341bdfeb6a3ab92c","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":3.69,"end":6.13,"text":"Calliope Mori","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":6.13,"end":8.12,"text":"Gawr Gura","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":8.12,"end":10.47,"text":"わがままでもおっけー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":10.47,"end":13.47,"text":"ほらだって あたしって特別","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":13.79,"end":15.6,"text":"あらあら 泣いちゃって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":15.6,"end":17.11,"text":"可愛くって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":17.11,"end":18.92,"text":"かぷってしちゃうから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":18.92,"end":21.32,"text":"Toss out the attitude, sir, where's your thought and gratitude?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":21.32,"end":24.0,"text":"We're mad at you! So grab a few defenses, you'll be glad you're screwed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":24.0,"end":25.39,"text":"Would I fight with you? Wouldn't waste my time","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":25.39,"end":26.76,"text":"The mood's right so this go-around the honor's all mine","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":26.76,"end":27.96,"text":"No place to run, don't you ever hide","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":27.96,"end":29.54,"text":"Only time I wanna see you down is on ya knees, at my side!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":29.54,"end":31.21,"text":"どうなってんのよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":31.21,"end":32.37,"text":"我々こそが Queen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":32.37,"end":33.71,"text":"どうなってんのよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":33.71,"end":35.43,"text":"解らせてあげるわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":35.43,"end":38.43,"text":"逆らうなら 痛い（痛い）痛い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":38.84,"end":40.24,"text":"ご褒美あげましょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":40.24,"end":43.11,"text":"(Whoa-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":43.11,"end":45.65,"text":"Don't bite the hand that feeds you if it's holding a knife","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":45.65,"end":48.48,"text":"(Whoa-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":48.48,"end":49.63,"text":"Still gotcha tongue tied?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":49.63,"end":51.66,"text":"Guess you better gimme your life","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":51.66,"end":54.66,"text":"解ったら Yesを聞かせて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":64.25,"end":66.29,"text":"あー 壊しちゃいたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":66.29,"end":67.83,"text":"モノにしちゃいたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":67.83,"end":69.06,"text":"甘いリップの中で狂って？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":69.06,"end":71.58,"text":"がおー 喰っちゃうぞ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":71.58,"end":73.05,"text":"ほら ぐちゃってして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":73.05,"end":75.66,"text":"生きたいと何度も願って？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":75.66,"end":76.51,"text":"Give you a kiss tonight","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":76.51,"end":78.07,"text":"That prey you're stalking's got bite","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":78.07,"end":80.83,"text":"Talkin' shit? You only exist to get pissed and fight","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":80.83,"end":82.1,"text":"Slow brain, no shame, what you gotta say now?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":82.1,"end":83.27,"text":"Tired of the ones that were running the game?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":83.27,"end":84.75,"text":"Now there's no escape, you ain't the boss of us","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":84.75,"end":86.02,"text":"There's no caution tape for the monstrous","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":86.02,"end":88.9,"text":"It's over, for you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":88.9,"end":90.55,"text":"どうなってんのよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":90.55,"end":91.51,"text":"我々こそがQueen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":91.51,"end":92.97,"text":"どうなってんのよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":92.97,"end":94.71000000000001,"text":"解らせてあげるわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":94.71000000000001,"end":97.71000000000001,"text":"逆らうなら 痛い（痛い）痛い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":98.25999999999999,"end":99.78,"text":"ご褒美あげましょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":99.78,"end":102.39,"text":"(Whoa-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":102.39,"end":104.47,"text":"Don't bite the hand that feeds you if it's holding a knife","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":104.47,"end":107.47,"text":"(Whoa-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":107.9,"end":109.13,"text":"Still gotcha tongue tied?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":109.13,"end":110.50999999999999,"text":"Guess you better gimme your life","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":110.50999999999999,"end":112.00999999999999,"text":"どうなってんのよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":112.00999999999999,"end":113.18,"text":"我々こそがQueen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":113.18,"end":114.4,"text":"どうなってんのよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":114.4,"end":116.55,"text":"解らせてあげるわ","t